@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
        <h3 class="card-title">@ViewData["Title"]</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
        <p>Agrumy stores the data needed to run your devices and nothing more:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account data</strong> - email address, optional name and phone number, and your chosen display time zone.</li>
            <li><strong>Device telemetry</strong> - sensor readings (temperature, humidity, soil moisture, and similar) and device diagnostic events, linked to your devices.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Your data stays within your own tenant: other tenants' users cannot see it. It is not shared with or sold to third parties.</p>
        <p class="mb-0">Agrumy is currently alpha software under active development. For questions about your data, or to have your account and its data removed, contact your administrator.</p>
    </div>
</div>
